    "_comment": [
        "Map for gems3_split.split_gems_records(): records that are also in another source go to separate sets of",
        "backup json / .pdb / .ndx files tagged THEREDA.<tag_infix>.<version>; the rest stays in the main set.",
        "formulas = formulas of the solid species of CEMDATA 18 (databases/CEMDATA/data-in/cemdata18.solids.json and",
        ".reactions.json; the value is the CEMDATA species name, for reference only). A solid THEREDA DComp/ReacDC record",
        "with the same element composition belongs to the group; a phase moves when all its species do (pure phases and",
        "solid solutions with their end-members). Data sources (SDref) are not split: a key may exist in one database of a GEMS project only (split_sdref: true would copy them).",
        "exclude_species = THEREDA records with the formula of a CEMDATA species but that are another phase (polymorphs).",
        "phases = optional extra THEREDA phase symbols (or fnmatch patterns) to move regardless of their formulas.",
        "Further groups (applied in this order to what is left): the rest of THEREDA by state - aqueous species (+ the aq phase), solids (+ pure and solid-solution phases) and gases/fluids (species only: the gas phase is not exported). Tags THEREDA.main.aqueous / .main.solids / .main.gases; IComp and anything with another state stay in the main files (tag THEREDA)."
